{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>and they ate</b> — The meaning is \"exceedingly,\" like: והיה לכם לזרא (and it shall be to you for loathing)." "<b>He brings</b> — It means \"He was bringing,\" like the pattern of: יעשו עגל בחורב (they made a calf at Horeb)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 78, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:05.235174438Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}